    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A ride home turns into a nightmare you never asked for.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was just another night. Just another road through the forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Case Blind: Stolen Route</strong> is a first-person psychological horror game where a quiet bike ride spirals into a terrifying journey of survival, fear, and fractured hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up trapped in a strange place, no idea where you are or how you got there. What follows is a desperate escape, eerie encounters, and choices that can save lives\u2026 or leave them behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore. Hide. Think fast. And trust no one too easily.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Key Features</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Storytelling</strong>: A slow burning, emotional horror experience built for immersion.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore &amp; Interact</strong>: Investigate your surroundings, solve subtle puzzles, and piece together the truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tense Audio Design</strong> \u2013 Every step and whisper keeps you alert headphones highly recommended.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Stealth Survival</strong>: Stay low, stay quiet, and avoid those watching from the dark.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices That Matter</strong>: Help others\u2026 or focus on escaping. Every decision counts.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A ride home turns into a nightmare you never asked for.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was just another night. Just another road through the forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Case Blind: Stolen Route</strong> is a first-person psychological horror game where a quiet bike ride spirals into a terrifying journey of survival, fear, and fractured hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up trapped in a strange place, no idea where you are or how you got there. What follows is a desperate escape, eerie encounters, and choices that can save lives\u2026 or leave them behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore. Hide. Think fast. And trust no one too easily.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Key Features</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Storytelling</strong>: A slow burning, emotional horror experience built for immersion.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore &amp; Interact</strong>: Investigate your surroundings, solve subtle puzzles, and piece together the truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tense Audio Design</strong> \u2013 Every step and whisper keeps you alert headphones highly recommended.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Stealth Survival</strong>: Stay low, stay quiet, and avoid those watching from the dark.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices That Matter</strong>: Help others\u2026 or focus on escaping. Every decision counts.</p></li></ul>",
